### Delete My Account (soft delete)
# There is no profile-update endpoint: UserController exposes GET and DELETE on /users/me only.
# This returns 202 Accepted -- the account is scheduled for permanent deletion 30 days out and a
# reactivation token is emailed.
DELETE http://localhost:8080/users/me
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "autoReactivationEnabled": true
}

###

### Reactivate My Account
# Uses the token from the deletion email, valid while the 30-day grace period lasts
POST http://localhost:8080/users/reactivate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reactivationToken": "TOKEN_FROM_DELETION_EMAIL"
}
